ant": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4710680/", "desc": "The Death Deliriant is a first-person survival horror game that blends cosmic horror with realistic mechanics. Find items to escape while evading enemies, replace the car battery, jack up the car, and perform other mechanical tasks while facing terror. Once you’re ready, drive the car out of there.", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710680/3f56cc7123e00fa915822949c84ebba2aabbca44/ss_3f56cc7123e00fa915822949c84ebba2aabbca44.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793272597", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710680/ea2ad0f012adfd7b918da00f389487727f923228/ss_ea2ad0f012adfd7b918da00f389487727f923228.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793272597"]}, "letitmelt": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/5343690/", "desc": "횃불로 눈을 녹이고, 물을 모으고, 아이들을 고용해 도움을 받으세요. 거대한 눈덩이, 눈사람, 불타는 전나무까지… 모두가 당신을 위해 일하는 아늑한 방치형 게임! 급수차를 가득 채우고, 특성을 해금하고, 진흙 트롤에 맞서 보세요!", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5343690/e92077546f57dbf57d0382f9c24916997f4eec6d/ss_e92077546f57dbf57d0382f9c24916997f4eec6d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793909774", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5343690/06d887cc5595b9727d68a27f8dba1445db512c05/ss_06d887cc5595b9727d68a27f8dba1445db512c05.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793909774"]}, "크로노오디세이": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2873440/", "desc": "크로노 오디세이 - 차세대 액션 MMORPG. 크로노 오디세이는 언리얼 엔진 5로 구동되는 장엄한 시각적 요소, 광대하고 세밀하게 구축된 심리스 오픈 월드, 시간 조작 및 다채로운 커스터마이징을 이용한 액션 기반의 역동적인 전투 메커니즘을 제공합니다.", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/ss_e751db5e229413f520c06c6acd845b3585da8cae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788925974", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/ss_aab3d8e7659e7dd916099abb51380e66cb526f25.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788925974"]}, "타임테이커즈": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3596040/", "desc": "타임 테이커즈는 3명씩 구성된 4개 팀이 최후의 한 팀이