4f9c0b9ea3fd25a6e0c7801c4a24.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772818247"]}, "waittheycanclimb": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/5484330/", "desc": "이 인크리멘탈 타워 디펜스에서 당신은 건물 꼭대기에 홀로 남아 수천 마리의 좀비에게 둘러싸여 있습니다. 포탑을 배치하고, 소총을 들고, 구조를 기다리며 10일 동안 살아남으세요. 하지만 조심하세요: 좀비는 기어오를 수 있습니다!", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5484330/5512e3e6cf09e56de57776e17df95100cea261af/ss_5512e3e6cf09e56de57776e17df95100cea261af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794098150", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5484330/84ac2d4c964e56dce6652aa44e81409ffc3ddc25/ss_84ac2d4c964e56dce6652aa44e81409ffc3ddc25.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794098150"]}, "bombanana": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4656000/", "desc": "원숭이 친구들과 함께하는 좌충우돌 신나는 폭탄 해체! 눈가리개, 귀마개, 입마개 원숭이로 구성된 3인 팀으로서 협동하세요. 개개인은 필요한 정보의 일부만 가지고 있습니다. 의사소통하고, 퍼즐을 풀고, 제한 시간을 맞추세요. 과연 폭탄이 터지기 전에 해체할 수 있을까요?", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656000/429d033410531fc2ec6ba0cd24956868beaff095/ss_429d033410531fc2ec6ba0cd24956868beaff095.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794217137", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656000/e476a3ed312794922d58c9553130922acc7f393d/ss_e476a3ed312794922d58c9553130922acc7f393d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794217137"]}, "findtheclover": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/5373980/", "desc": "Search a vast clover meadow for 50 rare specimens. Harvest by hand, upgrade to tools and garden machines, carry your crop to the buyer, and pour it out yourself. Bring special finds to your display cabinet.", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5373980/7c6077a536b6c3273126cd35d77e941414176a5f/ss_7c6077a536b6c3273126cd35d77e941414176a5f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792486527", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5373980/19a8aff9abc0d20cc786d4b6471ea37350686de1/ss_19a8aff9abc0d20cc786d4b6471ea37350686de1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792486527"]}, "고스트헌터": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2490960/", "desc": "《Ghost Hunter》 is an online collaborative psychological horror game that can be played by at least one and up to five players together. Unlike other ghost hunting games, it incorporates rich Taoist elements and experiences traditional Chinese supernatural culture.", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490960/54543747c7afd713938516aa8b4ea77b4af1fcad/ss_54543747c7afd713938516aa8b4ea77b4af1fcad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793592090", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490960/6100467d7822904fb6562de7f6f63c09fc0b1baf/ss_6100467d7822904fb6562de7f6f63c09fc0b1baf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793592090"]}, "시더시티": {}, "cindercity": {}, "부스터팩히어로즈": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4618570/", "desc": "어떤 팩에서든 강력한 카드가 나올 수 있는 증분형 게임, 부스터 팩 히어로즈에서 부스터 팩을 뜯고 포일 영웅을 뽑아보세요! 끝없는 몬스터들의 공세로부터 탑을 지키고 차원을 돌파하세요.", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618570/0704fbbf7f76ef5f2459c53447e42fc6b7c36281/ss_0704fbbf7f76ef5f2459c53447e42fc6b7c36281.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794316433", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618570/e6e587fb2f19c1742eb9858e56be8af707fdbd14/ss_e6e587fb2f19c1742eb9858e56be8af707fdbd14.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794316433"]}, "좀보이드": {}, "projectzomboid": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/108600/", "desc": "Project Zomboid is the ultimate in zombie survival. Alone or in MP: you loot, build, craft, fight, farm and fish in a struggle to survive. A hardcore RPG skillset, a vast map, massively customisable sandbox and a cute tutorial raccoon await the unwary. So how will you die? All it takes is a bite..", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/108600/e0dd37d69051f7da85896d11027ab018d23893fa/ss_e0dd37d69051f7da85896d11027ab018d23893fa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793224893", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/108600/d9df2102dd12526700b15660bc5ec8f039dc8742/ss_d9df2102dd12526700b15660bc5ec8f039dc8742.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793224893"]}, "다키스트던전": {}, "darkestdungeon": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/262060/", "desc": "Darkest Dungeon은 모험의 심리적 스트레스에 중점을 둔, 매력적인 고딕풍의 턴제 기반 RPG입니다. 미완성된 영웅의 팀을 고용, 훈련 그리고 리드하여 상상할 수 없는 공포, 스트레스, 기근, 질병 그리고 끊임없이 침식하는 암흑에 맞서세요. 모든 희망이 사라졌을 때 여러분의 영웅을 모두 지켜내세요!", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_04572edc979601b038756f87861c6f8c6c337806.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789168187", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_799c78932c87f2be0cbd45dd1b80ebd0a355e575.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789168187"]}, "아펠리오스": {}, "appelios": {}, "워해머서바이버즈": {}, "warhammersurvivors": {"url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3669620/", "desc": "Warhammer Survivors는 Warhammer 40,000 Boltgun 개발진이 선보이는 공식 그림다크 탄막 천국 서바이버톤 게임입니다. 40명이 넘는 Warhammer 40,000 및 Warhammer Age of Sigmar 세계관의 대표적인 챔피언으로 플레이하며 죽음과 파괴를 위해 싸우는 자들에게 죽음을 선사하세요.", "images": ["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669620/1712fd2c139929929c544c6728d962e27707b05f/ss_1712fd2c139929929c544c6728d962e27707b05f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794485359", "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669620/530db0d469982f4d9d85af6d53780dbdca0ffb5a/ss_530db0d469982f4d9d85af6d53780dbdca0ffb5a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794485359"]}}